# Oak & Marble

Public name is **Oak & Marble**. Lockup line: Design · Build · Remodel. Never “Marble & Oak.”

Boutique design-build remodeling for homeowners in Colleyville and nearby North Texas. Kitchen design and remodeling is the primary service. Whole-home and bathroom remodeling are core. Do not offer or imply new-home construction, general contracting, or standalone cabinetry or carpentry.

Voice is warm, clear, and human. Lead line: “Thoughtfully designed. Beautifully remodeled.” No inflated luxury claims or sales language. Do not present concept photos, stock photos, or supplier names as Oak & Marble projects or as an exclusive dealer relationship.

## Visual system

Tokens live in `src/styles/brand.css`. Use these values:

- Ivory `#F7F4ED` — page background
- Limestone `#E7DDCF` — quiet bands
- Warm Stone `#C9B7A3` — rules and dividers only (fails as text on ivory)
- Chestnut `#6E4E37` — labels and accents
- Charcoal `#3A342E` — text and dark bands

Titles and body use Montserrat through `--font-sans`. The wordmark stays artwork, not typed text: `src/assets/brand/wordmark-chestnut.png` on ivory, `src/assets/brand/wordmark-ivory.png` on charcoal. Do not set type in Cormorant, Canela, Didot, or Bodoni.

## Facts to keep exact

- Team experience is 10+ years. The company is a new independent brand, not a 10-year-old firm.
- 2-year labor and materials warranty, subject to the project warranty terms.
- Consultation is complimentary. The design fee is separate and is not credited toward construction.
- Typical project cost or cost range, not a quote or starting price: a large, finish-only kitchen at a basic level is $120,000–$170,000. Bathroom $75,000. Appliance purchase is not included in the kitchen range. Whole-home work is quoted from the approved design.

Approved nav: What We Do, Our Story, Our Process, Our Work, Costs Guide, Inquire. Our Story is the about section. Costs Guide is its own page at `/costs-guide`. Keep location pages out of the main menu. Do not present concept photos, stock photos, or supplier names as Oak & Marble projects.
